 "text": "ASSESSOR - Washington County, Missouri\nPAY TAXES\nELECTION INFO\nTown Square & Amphitheater\nABOUT\nGOVERNMENT\nAirport\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nAssociate Circuit Court Judge\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Commissioners\nCommission Agenda’s\nCommission Mintues\nCounty Clerk\nEmergency Management\nIndustrial Development Authority\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nCOMMUNITY\n✕\nABOUT\nGOVERNMENT\nAirport\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nAssociate Circuit Court Judge\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Commissioners\nCommission Agenda’s\nCommission Mintues\nCounty Clerk\nEmergency Management\nIndustrial Development Authority\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nCOMMUNITY\nASSESSOR\nHeather Eckhoff\nAssessor\nThe assessor develops and maintains a current list of all taxable real and personal property and assesses the property annually. Assessed valuation provides the tax base for property taxes levied by the county and its political subdivisions. She also processes and sends annual declaration forms for all personal property to county residents and does tax mapping by maintaining and updating property lines based upon information from the Recorders office.\nOffice Hours:\n8:00am to 4:30pm\nContacts\nPhone: 573-438-6111 option 3-3\nPersonal Property Phone Number: 573-438-4992\nReal Estate Phone Number: 573-438-2237\nFax: 573-436-7691\nCOURTHOUSE\n102 North Missouri Street\nPotosi, MO 63664\n(573) 438-6111\nEmail Us\nPrivacy / SMS Texting Privacy\nAll site contents © 2026\nWashington County is an Equal Opportunity Employer.",
